title: BattleTutorial
---
Let’s start your first battle!
<<Character tutorial>>
These are your vampire characters. Each one has a different class.
<<BlueBar tutorial>>
This is health and mana. When health runs out, the character dies. Each time a vampire uses a skill, it consumes mana. Choose carefully when to use your skills.
<<Arrow tutorial>>
This arrow means it is currently this character’s turn to act or take damage.
<<Enemy tutorial>>
These are the enemies. After selecting Attack, you can choose a target to attack.
Looks like the enemy is a wolf. wolves are good at single target physical attacks and can deal high damage to one target. They are relatively simple monsters, so let’s get started!
===

title: Round2OfFight1
---
Looks like a more dangerous enemy has appeared.
She looks like she can attack everyone, so we’d better deal with her first.
===

title: Round2OfFight2
---
evil scientist has appeared!!!
He seems to be able to heal enemies. so we’d better deal with him first.
===

title: Round2OfFight3
---
Unicorn has appeared!!!
The unicorn has a chance to prevent players from using their special skill.
